    {
      "id": "blk_933eaf31",
      "type": "note",
      "text": "此处的鸣式特指「鸣式·阿列夫一」\n此处的「赫龙格」代指「阿列夫一」",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
